#===============================================================

- title: Crypto DLL hijack via registry write
  description: It is possible to achieve persistence by
    hijacking one of the crypto DLLs, modifying the path in
    registry. This may also break the system if done stupidly.
  category: [persistence, registry]
  author: emryll
  score: 35

  components:
    - type: registry
      action:
        - create_key
        - set_value
      conditions:
        dir:
          - 'HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Cryptography\Defaults\Provider\'
        name:
          - 'Image Path'

  response: alert

#===============================================================

